# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust / Cargo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled output for every crate in the workspace (and the wasm frontend,
# which keeps its own `target/`). A bare `target/` matches any directory of
# that name at any depth.
target/

# Backup files emitted by `rustfmt`.
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC debug symbols.
*.pdb

# NOTE: `Cargo.lock` is intentionally committed — this workspace ships binaries
# (services + xtask) and the frontend, so the lockfile must be reproducible.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dioxus / WASM frontend (web/frontend)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `dx build` output and the flattened static bundle.
dist/
.dioxus/

# NOTE: `web/frontend/assets/main.css` is a hand-authored, self-contained
# stylesheet (see web/frontend/README.md) and MUST stay tracked. Only ignore
# CSS regenerated by the optional Tailwind CLI to a different file.
web/frontend/assets/tailwind.css

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / Tailwind tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment & secrets (never commit these)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / editor metadata
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent / assistant tooling caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.serena/cache/
.serena/*.local.yml
.junie/tools

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs & OS junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
